        "y0": 0.5730269930579446,
        "x1": 0.7803911196640114,
        "y1": 0.585606083725438
      },
      "text": "parameters used to approximate maps can be taken to be m × d, with m less than the",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
