        "y0": 0.754239138930735,
        "x1": 0.7805875142415365,
        "y1": 0.7668182295982284
      },
      "text": "dense in the set of continuous functions. Hence, quantitative approximation properties",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
